# Ephemeral SQLite databases created by `serverpod_test`.
#
# `serverpod_test` derives one database file per test group from the configured
# `database.filePath` (see config/test.yaml), and the SQLite adapter does not
# create missing parent directories. So this directory has to exist in a fresh
# checkout, which is why it is committed while its contents are ignored.
*
!.gitignore
